Z||000007||GarethWright||11-07-2001||11:12 PM||||When I get around to it I am going to back all of my interior pieces with double-sided adhesive foam tape. (available from Hobby Shops to secure radio recievers in RC Cars and Planes), that Should do the trick.||||reg||1
